<title>BRAZIL: Brazil orange juice industry reports weekly output.</title>
<headline>Brazil orange juice industry reports weekly output.</headline>
<dateline>RIO DE JANEIRO 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Brazilian Association of Citrus Exporters reported the following additional output and exports of frozen concentrated orange juice in metric tonnes 66 Brix for the period June 23-29 and the total for 1996/97.</p>
<p>The latest figures for the period are for out-of-season fruit processed but not included in previous bulletins. The export figure is a fine-tuning correction, Abecitrus said.</p>
<p>		June 23-29   June 24-30     TOTAL	  TOTAL</p>
<p>		 1996/97     1995/96	1996/97	1995/96</p>
<p> Stocks/open 109,340.7   155,140.5</p>
<p> Production   15,166.4		0 1,104,845.8    973,306.9</p>
<p> Shipment	  595.0     72,935.3 1,134,052.3  1,046,242.2</p>
<p> Home Market	   0	  336.1    16,329.2     18,466.3</p>
<p> Stocks/close   123,912.1   169,940.6</p>
<p>((-Caroline Bulloch, Rio de Janeiro newsroom, 5521 5074151))</p>
</text>
